OL,3,GNEWSASchool staff win award for saving
OL,4,Acyclist's life with CPR
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women who helped to save the life
OL,7,Fof a cyclist while on their lunch break
OL,8,Fat a Sussex school say performing CPR
OL,9,Fwas "nerve-wracking" but they did not
OL,10,Fwant to give up on keeping him alive.
OL,12,FKip Knowles collapsed on the South
OL,13,FDowns near Windlesham House School in
OL,14,FPulborough, where teachers Stacey
OL,15,FCharman and Chellie Messenger found him
OL,16,Fwhile walking dog Waffle.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
