OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool staff win award for saving
OL,4,Acyclist's life with CPR
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, alongside school nurse Claire
OL,7,FAgnew, have been recognised by St John
OL,8,FAmbulance after performing CPR for over
OL,9,F20 minutes, and reviving Kip with a
OL,10,Fdefibrillator before paramedics
OL,11,Farrived.
OL,13,FMessenger told BBC Breakfast: "Had we
OL,14,Fnot turned around from our walk we
OL,15,Fwouldn't have found Kip."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
